   "rationale": "Foreign-script garbage ('艦隊' Hanja/Japanese, '捕获' Simplified Chinese); '헌장' must be verbatim 'Constitution'; '반부정 QA' ('anti-corruption QA') is a meaning-changing calque; 됨/된다 register mixed with 합쇼체 of pf.lede; '수십개' spacing; '어플리케이션' non-standard spelling."
